meta {
  name: Get subscription-billing flags
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config/subscription-billing
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

assert {
  res.body.statusCode: isDefined
}

tests {
  test("prints each flag", function() {
    if (res.body.statusCode === 404) {
      console.log("namespace missing: every flag is at its code default (lineItemWrites on, the rest off)");
      return;
    }
    expect(res.body.statusCode).to.equal(200);
    const c = res.body.data.config || res.body.data;
    Object.keys(c).forEach(k => console.log(k + ": " + (c[k] && c[k].enabled)));
  });
}

docs {
  The on/off switches for the subscription billing revamp (`SubscriptionBillingFlags`, `DynamicConfigResource`).
  They live in the `dynamic_config` table, not in `config.yml`, and each plutus server re-reads them every 60 seconds.

  A 404 in the body means the namespace has never been written, so every flag is at its code default.

  | Flag | Default | Turns on | Also needs |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `cancelRefund` | off | admin cancel billing with refund (and its preview) | nothing |
  | `lineItemWrites` | ON | BASE line-item dual-write (kill switch) | nothing |
  | `lineItemMaths` | off | billing totals come from line items | lineItemWrites |
  | `externalPayments` | off | record/reverse external payments, advance routes, advance used on billing | lineItemMaths |
  | `truckAddon` | off | mid-cycle truck add-ons, BASE freeze | lineItemMaths |
  | `partialBilling` | off | admin partial charge | lineItemMaths + truckAddon |
  | `planChange` | off | plan-change routes (older plan routes delegate to them) | lineItemMaths + truckAddon |
  | `dueSweep` | off | hourly auto-debit of open dues, moves money unattended | lineItemMaths + truckAddon |
  | `unbilledTruckCheck` | off | daily log-only check for under-billed torgs | nothing |

  Read with any authenticated token. To change a flag, use "Set one subscription-billing flag".
}
